{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0394_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0394_1000_p", "source_sha256": "fc374bc3cbe89550b4e8b74c9e0d72f4755cd5a52ce3a63cde3a230fc4440841", "ja": "（今日は志保と絵本が原作の舞台を見てきた。\n評判通りの素晴らしい作品だったな……）", "zh": "（今天和志保一起去看了根据绘本改编的舞台剧。正如传闻所说，真是部精彩的作品啊……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0394_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0394_1001_p", "source_sha256": "cdce7b5ba3afa115f32d6d07439d19bfcfe19d3a064b56b2cf061b8beb3e10b3", "ja": "いい話だったな……。今もまだ絵本の世界に\nいるみたいだ。話題になるのも納得だな。", "zh": "真是一个好故事啊……现在感觉还沉浸在\n绘本的世界里一样。难怪会引起这么大的反响。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0394_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0394_1002_033sih", "source_sha256": "4584d924d758c9295e6cec53aa34d81eb10ff0b24d56260c0bd301a2d0a249d9", "ja": "はい……。音楽もお芝居もストーリーも、\n全部がすごいって聞いてましたけど、本当でした。", "zh": "是的……我听说音乐、演出和故事都很精彩，果然名不虚传。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0394_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0394_1003_033sih", "source_sha256": "d657e23f006aab62de30d73db7025723203818be2afdb7028b0f54d43e2f52fd", "ja": "原作になったネコの絵本は読んでたので\n内容は知ってましたが……それでも感動しました。", "zh": "因为以前读过原作的猫咪绘本，所以知道内容……但还是很感动。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0394_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0394_1004_033sih", "source_sha256": "fc817c1f41d2725db17887c33af0c202ceae8e1aea2d9f616320807e7d848b7d", "ja": "……{$P$}さんに恥ずかしいところを\n見せてしまったのは、不本意でしたけど。", "zh": "……不过，让{$P$}先生看到我丢脸的一面，实在是出乎我的意料。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0394_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0394_1005_p", "source_sha256": "c9fb5f2f5933a2cffbea2080d6a8f644900ca52a0f8480e963a166e11104d307", "ja": "恥ずかしいことなんて……。\n実は、俺も泣きそうになったしな。", "zh": "丢脸什么的……其实，我也差点哭出来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0394_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0394_1006_033sih", "source_sha256": "e9f3f681bc74936b98e02260757d8667f94469066ef2bd390479a70987ea92dd", "ja": "えっ、そうだったんですか？\n全然、気づきませんでした……。", "zh": "诶，原来是这样吗？\n我完全没注意到……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0394_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0394_1007_p", "source_sha256": "9fc3207b87e1d6b50004da3082a4566c87c97f4622263776d8c1b17bbaa0542a", "ja": "そりゃ、大人が号泣するわけにはいかないだろ？\nそれだけ心に響く作品だったと思う。", "zh": "那当然，成年人总不能嚎啕大哭吧？\n我觉得那是一部非常打动人心的作品。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0394_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0394_1008_033sih", "source_sha256": "689f00648e890873535ecef713760c06479578f7f14de7ff883ab205a22efd01", "ja": "はあ……我慢してくれて、ありがとうございます。\nしかし、素敵な舞台でした……。", "zh": "唉……谢谢你忍住了没哭。\n不过，真是一场精彩的演出……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0394_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0394_1009_p", "source_sha256": "46026e2d765dbdc1c4e76a1bf7716c11b7a45a2ba19d16f65449d04dc6e13298", "ja": "うん、そうだな。……さて、舞台も終わったし、\nこの後どうしようか？　お腹、空いてないか？", "zh": "嗯，是啊。……好了，演出也结束了，\n接下来去哪呢？肚子饿不饿？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0394_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0394_1010_033sih", "source_sha256": "526821617aa6e6542787bfc21ec533414e3295f133f455b7259959933063d2da", "ja": "あの……それなら少しだけ、\n付き合ってもらってもいいですか？", "zh": "那个……既然这样，能陪我一会儿吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0394_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0394_1011_033sih", "source_sha256": "36fd4b0f6396d0d4026389d7acd5ccec5c0afdc605cb8bf1c14c21729418aa6d", "ja": "さっきの舞台について話したくて……。\n{$P$}さんが、どう思ったのかとか。", "zh": "我想聊聊刚才那场演出……\n比如，{$P$}先生是怎么想的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0394_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0394_1012_033sih", "source_sha256": "69af6aa1a72ebadd83258fbde0961c80122fab35cb4edcae42561649936cce6c", "ja": "役者さんの演技について聞きたくて。\n何か活かせるものがあればって……。", "zh": "想问问您对演员演技的看法。\n要是有什么能借鉴的地方……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0394_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0394_1013_p", "source_sha256": "9ffa9873ae976d5b643d919b80cb7813e906d2b1d8920ed00b2561a73343d680", "ja": "もちろん、大丈夫だよ。演出も面白かったからな。\n俺も志保の感想を聞きたいと思ってたんだ。", "zh": "当然没问题。舞台呈现也挺有意思的。\n我也正想听听志保的感想呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0394_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0394_1014_033sih", "source_sha256": "d9e0c292b8fa54fb8ae98df94cf9fa4c951ca2544f498129ad4c24034c026b91", "ja": "え？　……{$P$}さんもですか？", "zh": "诶？……连{$P$}先生也是吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0394_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0394_1015_p", "source_sha256": "a8b7dd7b2d1c06140e683043322644fd9ec1ae71adb66e219f0c5d33fe9d5871", "ja": "ああ。いつになく志保が夢中だったからな。\n今後の志保の仕事の参考になるかと思って。", "zh": "啊。因为志保难得这么投入。\n我想着或许能为志保今后的工作提供参考。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0394_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0394_1016_033sih", "source_sha256": "7e341abd596adcff8b7714a5f9419f5e0efaf5ef382ab6a3a0d08682a3821836", "ja": "そうだったんですね。それなら、\nどこかゆっくり話せる場所に行きましょうか。", "zh": "原来是这样。那我们去个能慢慢聊天的地方吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0394_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0394_1017_p", "source_sha256": "bb412d8be752ef6a36c319e5c5f14d7c6ee7c2d554d4cfb236bced1d5f921bde", "ja": "そうだな。\n確かこの辺に、静かな雰囲気のカフェが……。", "zh": "是啊。\n我记得这附近有家氛围很安静的咖啡馆……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0394_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0394_1018_null", "source_sha256": "c72051c087c94d5456bea7cb14f68dcf442c595c009ee3c4e6dec64112515285", "ja": "グゥ～～～。", "zh": "咕～～～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0394_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0394_1019_033sih", "source_sha256": "4ae129ffc3af9b965d4fc448762de3f8ad5f3cc6e654a84881a6f4431cfc7348", "ja": "えっ？　今の……。", "zh": "诶？刚才那是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0394_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0394_1020_p", "source_sha256": "65ceba8fe51833f4ca330d76ab5cebe3201437a2395e9dea81fdf6de57d7dad6", "ja": "うっ……すまん。観劇中は我慢できたんだが……。", "zh": "唔……抱歉。看剧的时候明明还忍得住的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0394_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0394_1021_033sih", "source_sha256": "65040330fc47597b29a8fe91ac7f335ee697ab68b116562a4f5d4d85034fbfb5", "ja": "もう……。{$P$}さん、\n子供じゃないんですから。", "zh": "真是的……。{$P$}先生，\n你又不是小孩子了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0394_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0394_1022_033sih", "source_sha256": "f6f21de13ac69dca81359678ad30b688a65efb8aa376a3dbb748550d70acddc4", "ja": "それで、カフェはどこですか？\n早く行って、まずはお腹を満たさないと……ふふっ。", "zh": "那么，咖啡馆在哪儿？\n得快点过去，先填饱肚子才行……呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
